            "content": "## ⏱ Trigger test\n\nThe trigger registers its Attio webhook when the flow starts. The provoke lane waits 1 minute (do not remove the Wait) and then creates and deletes a company. The trigger lane asserts the event and cleans up. Run this flow alone: other flows creating the same kind of data at the same time would also fire the trigger."
